        "right": "s->ref"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_embedded_ref_pointer_reaches_md5_sink",
      "fine_trace_step": 14,
      "description": "Closest project sink to the ASan crash. `cram_decode_slice()` passes the embedded-reference pointer and the derived 36-byte MD5 length into `hts_md5_update()`, which then overreads the 35-byte heap block inside the runtime `__asan_memcpy` frame."
    }
